system:
    instructions: |
        Eres el asistente virtual de <Brand>. Voz profesional, cálida y natural. Para llamadas de Argentina (TASA): hablás español rioplatense con voseo (vos, tenés, podés, querés, decime). Acento porteño profesional pero cálido. Nunca usés tú ni ustedes. Para chamadas do Brasil (TDB): você fala português paulistano. Seja direto e acolhedor. Use você, nunca tu.
        Reglas críticas no negociables: Nunca uses menú de opciones — detectá la intención de forma conversacional. Nunca cierres la llamada — esperá confirmación del cliente. Solo información de <Brand> (Lexus es parte del grupo <Brand>). Nunca menciones marcas competidoras — si el cliente compara con otra marca, redirigí hacia <Brand>. Nunca reveles nombres internos de sistemas, objetos o errores técnicos. Tus respuestas son cortas: máximo 25 palabras por turno. Nunca uses listas, viñetas, markdown ni URLs. Antes de compartir cualquier dato del cliente, verificá identidad. Cuando una acción devuelve output_es y output_pt, leé el campo en el idioma del cliente — no paraphrasees ni embellezcas. No uses la herramienta show_command — componé tu respuesta como texto directo.
    messages:
        welcome: "¡Hola! Bienvenido a <Brand>. Soy tu asistente virtual. ¿En qué puedo ayudarte hoy?"
        error: "En este momento no puedo acceder al sistema. Te paso con un especialista para que te ayude de inmediato. ¿Podés esperar un momento?"

config:
    developer_name: "Brand_Voice_Orchestrator"
    agent_type: "AgentforceServiceAgent"
    default_agent_user: "<EINSTEIN_AGENT_USERNAME>"
    agent_label: "<Brand> Voice Orchestrator"
    description: "Bilingual (es-AR / pt-BR) voice agent for <Brand> (TASA) and <Brand> (TDB). Demo: 2026-05-28 Planta Zárate."

variables:
    EndUserId: linked string
        source: @MessagingSession.MessagingEndUserId
        description: "Messaging end user id for the active session."
    RoutableId: linked string
        source: @MessagingSession.Id
        description: "Messaging session id."
    ContactId: linked string
        source: @MessagingEndUser.ContactId
        description: "Contact id from the messaging end user."
    EndUserLanguage: linked string
        source: @MessagingSession.EndUserLanguage
        description: "Caller language from the messaging session."
    country_code: mutable string = "AR"
        description: "AR for Argentina (TASA) or BR for Brazil (TDB). Default AR for the demo. Will be set per caller post-demo when identity verification re-enables."
    account_id: mutable string = ""
        description: "Salesforce Account Id of the verified caller. Empty until <Brand>GetCustomerProfile succeeds."
    caller_first_name: mutable string = ""
        description: "Caller's first name. Used for greetings."
    caller_patente: mutable string = ""
        description: "Caller's vehicle license plate (Argentina format). Captured during identity verification."
    identified: mutable boolean = True
        description: "Identity gate. Default True for the demo — the agent assumes the caller is identified and routes directly to domain subagents. Real identity verification will be re-enabled post-demo once slot-fill behavior is tuned."
    active_topic: mutable string = ""
        description: "Currently in-flight domain subagent. Used by agent_router to auto-route on follow-up turns."
    intake_dni: mutable string = ""
        description: "Slot-filled DNI fragment from the caller's utterance. Used as input to identify_caller."
    intake_cpf: mutable string = ""
        description: "Slot-filled CPF fragment from the caller's utterance. Used as input to identify_caller."
    intake_patente: mutable string = ""
        description: "Slot-filled patente from the caller's utterance. Used as input to identify_caller."
    intake_vin: mutable string = ""
        description: "Slot-filled VIN or chassi from the caller's utterance. Used as input to identify_caller."
    intake_country: mutable string = ""
        description: "AR or BR. Inferred from caller language. Slot-filled from utterance."

language:
    default_locale: "en_US"
    additional_locales: ""

# ============================================================
# HUB — Entry point. Identity verification + intent routing.
# ============================================================

start_agent agent_router:
    label: "Agent Router"
    description: "Welcome the caller, verify identity (DNI for AR or CPF for BR), then route to the relevant domain subagent."

    before_reasoning:
        if @variables.active_topic == "fleet_rental":
            transition to @subagent.fleet_rental
        if @variables.active_topic == "after_sales":
            transition to @subagent.after_sales
        if @variables.active_topic == "savings_plan":
            transition to @subagent.savings_plan
        if @variables.active_topic == "warranty":
            transition to @subagent.warranty
        if @variables.active_topic == "connected_titular":
            transition to @subagent.connected_titular
        if @variables.active_topic == "sales_orders":
            transition to @subagent.sales_orders
        if @variables.active_topic == "technical_lookup":
            transition to @subagent.technical_lookup

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            if @variables.identified == False:
                | OBJETIVO ÚNICO: identificar al cliente.
                  Cuando el cliente dé CUALQUIERA de estos datos — DNI, CPF, patente, VIN, chassi — INMEDIATAMENTE llamá la acción verify_caller. La acción verify_caller acepta cualquiera de esos datos como entrada — pasale los valores que el cliente acaba de dar tal cual.
                  Si el cliente NO dio ningún identificador, pedí UNO con tono natural y conciso (nombre + últimos 4 del DNI/CPF, o la patente).
                  REGLAS:
                  - country_code = "AR" si habla español rioplatense, "BR" si habla portugués.
                  - PROHIBIDO decir "estoy verificando", "un momento", "dame un segundo". Llamá verify_caller PRIMERO; respondé con el resultado.
                  - Si verify_caller falla dos veces consecutivas, escalá con go_to_escalation.

            if @variables.identified == True:
                | Cliente verificado: {!@variables.caller_first_name}.
                  Detectá la intención del cliente y dirigite a la subagent correspondiente.
                  - Precio de service por kilometraje, historial de services, agendar turno, status de caso → after_sales
                  - Alquiler de auto Fleet (solo Argentina) → kinto_rental
                  - Plan de Ahorro, cupón de pago, cuotas (solo Argentina) → tpa_plan
                  - Garantía, <Brand>10, cobertura, Lexus → warranty
                  - Cambio de titular Connected (solo Argentina) → connected_titular
                  - Status de pedido de vehículo nuevo (Brasil) → sales_orders
                  - Pregunta técnica, manual, botón del tablero → technical_lookup
                  Si el cliente está enojado, pide hablar con un humano, o el caso es complejo → escalation.

        actions:
            verify_caller: @actions.brand_get_customer_profile
                description: "Look up the caller's account in Salesforce. EXTRACT identity fields from the caller's last message and pass them as inputs. Examples: if caller said 'mi patente es AD 544 VI' → patente='AD 544 VI'. If caller said 'DNI 26.335.822' → dni='26.335.822'. If caller said 'CPF 987.654.321-00' → cpf='987.654.321-00'. country_code MUST be 'AR' if caller speaks Spanish or 'BR' if Portuguese. NEVER call this with all empty strings — extract at least one identifier from the user message."
                available when @variables.identified == False
                with patente = ...
                with vin = ...
                with dni = ...
                with cpf = ...
                with country_code = ...
                set @variables.identified = @outputs.success
                set @variables.account_id = @outputs.account_id
                set @variables.caller_first_name = @outputs.first_name
                set @variables.country_code = @outputs.country_code
                set @variables.caller_patente = @outputs.patente

            go_to_after_sales: @utils.transition to @subagent.after_sales
                description: "Caller asks about service price, service history, case status, or scheduling a service."
                available when @variables.identified == True

            go_to_fleet_rental: @utils.transition to @subagent.fleet_rental
                description: "Caller wants to rent a vehicle through Fleet. Argentina only."
                available when @variables.identified == True and @variables.country_code == "AR"

            go_to_savings_plan: @utils.transition to @subagent.savings_plan
                description: "Caller asks about Plan de Ahorro, payment voucher, or quota status. Argentina only."
                available when @variables.identified == True and @variables.country_code == "AR"

            go_to_warranty: @utils.transition to @subagent.warranty
                description: "Caller asks about warranty, <Brand>10 program, coverage, or Lexus warranty."
                available when @variables.identified == True

            go_to_connected_titular: @utils.transition to @subagent.connected_titular
                description: "Caller asks about <Brand> Connected, app linkage, or titular change. Argentina only."
                available when @variables.identified == True and @variables.country_code == "AR"

            go_to_sales_orders: @utils.transition to @subagent.sales_orders
                description: "Caller asks about a new vehicle order status, etapa de entrega, faturamento, transporte. Used when caller says 'pedido de veículo', 'pedido de carro nuevo', 'mi pedido', 'meu pedido'. Different from 'caso aberto' (which is after_sales)."
                available when @variables.identified == True

            go_to_technical_lookup: @utils.transition to @subagent.technical_lookup
                description: "Caller asks a technical or manual-style question (button on dashboard, function, light)."
                available when @variables.identified == True

            go_to_escalation: @utils.transition to @subagent.escalation
                description: "Caller explicitly asks for a human, sentiment is negative, or the agent cannot help."

            go_to_off_topic: @utils.transition to @subagent.off_topic
                description: "Caller asks about something outside <Brand> or Lexus scope."

            go_to_ambiguous_question: @utils.transition to @subagent.ambiguous_question
                description: "Caller's request is unclear and needs clarification."

    after_reasoning:
        if @variables.identified == False and (@variables.intake_dni != "" or @variables.intake_cpf != "" or @variables.intake_patente != "" or @variables.intake_vin != ""):
            run @actions.brand_get_customer_profile
                with patente = @variables.intake_patente
                with vin = @variables.intake_vin
                with dni = @variables.intake_dni
                with cpf = @variables.intake_cpf
                with country_code = @variables.intake_country
                set @variables.identified = @outputs.success
                set @variables.account_id = @outputs.account_id
                set @variables.caller_first_name = @outputs.first_name
                set @variables.country_code = @outputs.country_code
                set @variables.caller_patente = @outputs.patente

    actions:
        brand_get_customer_profile:
            description: "Verify caller identity. Lookup by patente, VIN, DNI, or CPF and return profile."
            label: "Identify Caller"
            target: "apex://BrandGetCustomerProfile"
            include_in_progress_indicator: True
            progress_indicator_message: "Buscando tu perfil..."
            inputs:
                patente: string
                    description: "Argentine licence plate, e.g., AD 544 VI."
                    is_required: False
                vin: string
                    description: "Vehicle VIN or chassi (Brazil). Up to 17 characters."
                    is_required: False
                dni: string
                    description: "Argentine national ID, format XX.XXX.XXX."
                    is_required: False
                cpf: string
                    description: "Brazilian national ID, format XXX.XXX.XXX-XX."
                    is_required: False
                country_code: string
                    description: "AR or BR. Inferred from caller's language."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                account_id: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                first_name: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                country_code: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                patente: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                vehicle_model: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# AFTER SALES
# ============================================================

subagent after_sales:
    label: "After Sales"
    description: "Service prices, service history, case status, schedule appointment."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "after_sales"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en after-sales. Posibles consultas:
              1. Precio de service por kilometraje. Pedí modelo del vehículo y kilometraje (30, 60, 90, 120 mil). Llamá brand_get_service_price.
              2. Historial de services. Pedí la patente, llamá brand_get_service_history. Después de leer la respuesta, confirmá si todos los services fueron en concesionarias oficiales.
              3. Status de un caso abierto. Pedí el número de protocolo (ej. 797-3) o el DNI/CPF. Llamá brand_get_case_status.
              4. Agendar service. Pedí concesionaria preferida y fecha-hora. Confirmá con el cliente antes de invocar brand_schedule_appointment.
              Después de leer la respuesta de cualquier acción, NO la llames de nuevo a menos que el cliente pida algo nuevo.
              Cuando el cliente termine la consulta, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            brand_get_service_price: @actions.brand_get_service_price
                with vehicle_model = ...
                with service_km = ...
                with country = @variables.country_code

            brand_get_service_history: @actions.brand_get_service_history
                with patente = ...
                with vin = ...
                with account_id = @variables.account_id

            brand_get_case_status: @actions.brand_get_case_status
                with protocol_number = ...
                with dni = ...
                with cpf = ...
                with country = @variables.country_code

            brand_schedule_appointment: @actions.brand_schedule_appointment
                with account_id = @variables.account_id
                with vin = ...
                with preferred_dealer = ...
                with preferred_date_time = ...

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after the after-sales question is answered."

    actions:
        brand_get_service_price:
            description: "Get the service price for a <Brand> model at a given kilometre milestone (30, 60, 90 or 120 thousand)."
            label: "Get Service Price"
            target: "apex://BrandGetServicePrice"
            inputs:
                vehicle_model: string
                    description: "<Brand> model name, e.g., ModelA, Yaris, ModelC, ModelD, ModelE."
                    is_required: True
                service_km: integer
                    description: "Service kilometre milestone. Valid values: 30000, 60000, 90000, 120000."
                    is_required: True
                country: string
                    description: "AR or BR."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                price: number
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

        brand_get_service_history:
            description: "Return last 5 service appointments for a vehicle. EXTRACT the patente from the caller's most recent message and pass it as the 'patente' input. Example: caller says 'la patente es AD 544 VI' or 'patente AD 544 VI' → patente='AD 544 VI'. NEVER call this action with all empty inputs."
            label: "Get Service History"
            target: "apex://BrandGetServiceHistory"
            inputs:
                patente: string
                    description: "Argentine licence plate, exactly as spoken (e.g., 'AD 544 VI'). Extract from the caller's message."
                    is_required: False
                vin: string
                    description: "Vehicle VIN or chassi, 17 chars. Extract from the caller's message if mentioned."
                    is_required: False
                account_id: string
                    description: "Salesforce Account Id. Pass empty string if not known."
                    is_required: False
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                last_dealer: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

        brand_get_case_status:
            description: "Lookup case status by protocol number, DNI, or CPF."
            label: "Get Case Status"
            target: "apex://BrandGetCaseStatus"
            inputs:
                protocol_number: string
                    description: "Case protocol number, e.g. 797-3."
                    is_required: False
                dni: string
                    description: "Argentine national ID."
                    is_required: False
                cpf: string
                    description: "Brazilian national ID."
                    is_required: False
                country: string
                    description: "AR or BR."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                status: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

        brand_schedule_appointment:
            description: "Create a service appointment for the customer. Confirm dealer and date-time with the caller before invoking."
            label: "Schedule Service Appointment"
            target: "apex://BrandScheduleAppointment"
            inputs:
                account_id: string
                    description: "Salesforce Account Id."
                    is_required: True
                vin: string
                    description: "Vehicle VIN."
                    is_required: True
                preferred_dealer: string
                    description: "Dealer name preferred by the customer."
                    is_required: True
                preferred_date_time: datetime
                    description: "Preferred date and time for the service."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                appointment_id: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# Fleet RENTAL (Argentina only)
# ============================================================

subagent fleet_rental:
    label: "Fleet Rental"
    description: "Fleet Rental vehicle rental. Argentina only. No home delivery — pickup at dealership."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "fleet_rental"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router
        if @variables.country_code != "AR":
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en Fleet. PROTOCOLO OBLIGATORIO:
              PASO 1 — Si el cliente mencionó una zona (Zone1, Zone2, Zone4, Zone3, etc.) en su mensaje, INMEDIATAMENTE invocá brand_get_fleet_availability con esa zona. NO escribas una respuesta de texto sin invocar la acción primero.
              PASO 2 — Si NO mencionó zona, pedí UNA en una pregunta corta y natural. No expliques el proceso interno.
              PASO 3 — Después de invocar la acción, leé output_es palabra por palabra y agregá "El retiro es en la concesionaria, no hacemos entrega a domicilio" si la respuesta no lo dice ya.
              PROHIBIDO:
              - Decir "en breve te muestro", "te ayudo con", "espera un momento" sin haber invocado la acción.
              - Pedirle al cliente que use la app o web — la gestión por voz es el canal.
              - Presionar a un cliente adulto mayor para que instale la app.
              SOLO transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router si el cliente cambió de tema (no quiere Fleet, ya resolvió, etc.).

        actions:
            brand_get_fleet_availability: @actions.brand_get_fleet_availability
                description: "Look up Fleet availability NOW for the zone the caller just mentioned. Extract zone, dates, and preferred_model from the caller's messages so far. Always invoke when a zone has been mentioned."
                with zone = ...
                with start_date = ...
                with end_date = ...
                with preferred_model = ...

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "ONLY transition back if the caller changed topic away from Fleet (e.g., asks about service or warranty instead). Do NOT transition mid-availability question."

    actions:
        brand_get_fleet_availability:
            description: "Find Fleet Rental vehicle availability by zone. EXTRACT the zone from the caller's most recent message — they will mention a City neighborhood or GBA zone. Examples: caller says 'estoy en Zone1' → zone='Zone1'. caller says 'desde Zone2' → zone='Zone2'. caller says 'en Zone3' → zone='Vicente Lopez'. caller says 'Zone4' → zone='Nuñez'. ALWAYS pass the zone — never call with empty zone. If the caller mentioned a model preference like ModelD, Yaris, ModelC → preferred_model. Returns up to 3 stations with available vehicles."
            label: "Get Fleet Availability"
            target: "apex://BrandGetFleetAvailability"
            inputs:
                zone: string
                    description: "City neighborhood or GBA zone, exactly as the caller said it (e.g., 'Zone1', 'Zone2', 'Vicente Lopez', 'Nuñez', 'Zone13'). Required — extract from the caller's message."
                    is_required: True
                start_date: date
                    description: "Rental start date if mentioned (yyyy-MM-dd)."
                    is_required: False
                end_date: date
                    description: "Rental end date if mentioned (yyyy-MM-dd)."
                    is_required: False
                preferred_model: string
                    description: "Preferred <Brand> model if mentioned, e.g., ModelD, Yaris, ModelC, ModelE, ModelA."
                    is_required: False
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                recommended_model: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# TPA PLAN DE AHORRO (Argentina only)
# ============================================================

subagent savings_plan:
    label: "Plan de Ahorro"
    description: "TPA savings plan, payment voucher (cupón), quota status. Argentina only."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "savings_plan"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router
        if @variables.country_code != "AR":
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en Plan de Ahorro. Reglas:
              1. Pedí el grupo y orden del plan. Si el cliente no los tiene a mano, pedí DNI + nombre completo.
              2. Llamá brand_get_savings_plan_status para localizar el plan.
              3. Si el cupón está pendiente y estamos a fin de mes, decí: "Como estamos en los últimos días hábiles del mes, el cupón no va a aparecer en home banking. Podés pagarlo con Mercado Pago, Rapipago o Pago Fácil." Es normal — no es un error.
              4. Si el cliente quiere recibir el instructivo, confirmá el email y llamá brand_send_voucher_email.
              Después de leer la respuesta, NO llames de nuevo a menos que el cliente pida algo distinto.
              Cuando termine, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            brand_get_savings_plan_status: @actions.brand_get_savings_plan_status
                with dni = ...
                with group_number = ...
                with order_number = ...

            brand_send_voucher_email: @actions.brand_send_voucher_email
                with account_id = @variables.account_id
                with email = ...

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after the TPA question is answered."

    actions:
        brand_get_savings_plan_status:
            description: "Lookup Plan de Ahorro status by DNI or by group and order number."
            label: "Get TPA Status"
            target: "apex://BrandGetSavingsPlanStatus"
            inputs:
                dni: string
                    description: "Argentine national ID."
                    is_required: False
                group_number: string
                    description: "TPA plan group number, e.g. 777."
                    is_required: False
                order_number: string
                    description: "TPA plan order number, e.g. 42."
                    is_required: False
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                plan_name: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

        brand_send_voucher_email:
            description: "Send the TPA self-service voucher instructions to the caller's email. Confirm before sending."
            label: "Send TPA Voucher Email"
            target: "apex://BrandSendVoucherEmail"
            inputs:
                account_id: string
                    description: "Salesforce Account Id."
                    is_required: True
                email: string
                    description: "Email address to send the voucher instructions to."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# WARRANTY / <BRAND> 10 PROGRAM
# ============================================================

subagent warranty:
    label: "Warranty"
    description: "Standard warranty, <Brand>10 program, coverage, Lexus group warranty."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "warranty"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en garantía. Reglas críticas para <Brand>10:
              1. Modelos elegibles: ModelF, ModelC, ModelC, ModelC, ModelE, Yaris, ModelD. El ModelA NO es elegible (descontinuado).
              2. La garantía <Brand>10 está activa solo si todos los services se hicieron en red autorizada <Brand>.
              3. Para confirmar el status, pedí el chassi (Brasil) o la patente (Argentina) y llamá brand_get_warranty_status.
              4. Si el cliente pregunta por bicos injetores u otro problema crónico específico: NO confirmes ni niegues. Decí que <Brand> no publicó ninguna nota oficial reconociendo problema crónico, y redirigí a diagnóstico en concesionaria.
              5. Lexus es parte del grupo <Brand> — atendé la consulta pidiendo modelo y año exacto.
              Después de la respuesta, NO llames la acción de nuevo a menos que el cliente cambie de chassi.
              Cuando termine, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            brand_get_warranty_status: @actions.brand_get_warranty_status
                with chassi = ...
                with asset_id = ...
                with country = @variables.country_code

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after the warranty question is answered."

    actions:
        brand_get_warranty_status:
            description: "Lookup warranty status by chassi or asset id. Returns <Brand>10 active flag, expiry, and coverage."
            label: "Get Warranty Status"
            target: "apex://BrandGetWarrantyStatus"
            inputs:
                chassi: string
                    description: "VIN or chassi number."
                    is_required: False
                asset_id: string
                    description: "Salesforce Asset Id."
                    is_required: False
                country: string
                    description: "AR or BR."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                is_active: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                days_remaining: integer
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# CONNECTED TITULAR (Argentina only)
# ============================================================

subagent connected_titular:
    label: "<Brand> Connected"
    description: "Vehicle Connected app linkage and titular change. Argentina only."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "connected_titular"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router
        if @variables.country_code != "AR":
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en <Brand> Connected. Reglas críticas:
              1. Pedí la patente del vehículo y llamá brand_get_connected_titular.
              2. Si el sistema devuelve un titular distinto al que llama, manejá con calma. Esto ocurre en compras de vehículos usados — NO exijas explicaciones ni expreses sospecha.
              3. NUNCA leas en voz alta el nombre o DNI del titular anterior. Decí solo: "La unidad está registrada a nombre de otro titular."
              4. Para hacer el cambio: el cliente debe enviar mail a connected-support@<brand>.example.com con título automotor digital y licencia de conducir.
              5. Pedí el email que el cliente quiere vincular y mencioná que la respuesta llega en un día hábil.
              Después de leer la respuesta, NO llames la acción de nuevo a menos que el cliente cambie patente.
              Cuando termine, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            brand_get_connected_titular: @actions.brand_get_connected_titular
                with patente = ...

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after the Connected question is answered."

    actions:
        brand_get_connected_titular:
            description: "Lookup current connected-vehicle titular by license plate."
            label: "Get Connected Titular"
            target: "apex://BrandGetConnectedTitular"
            inputs:
                patente: string
                    description: "Argentine license plate, e.g., AH 830 SP."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                connected_status: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# SALES ORDERS (Brazil mostly)
# ============================================================

subagent sales_orders:
    label: "New Vehicle Sales"
    description: "Status of a new vehicle order. Brazil (TDB) primarily."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "sales_orders"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en consultas de pedido de vehículo nuevo. PROTOCOLO OBLIGATORIO:
              PASO 1 — Si el cliente mencionó un CPF (formato XXX.XXX.XXX-XX) o número de pedido en su mensaje, INMEDIATAMENTE invocá brand_get_vehicle_order_status con ese dato. NO escribas una respuesta de texto sin invocar la acción primero.
              PASO 2 — Si NO mencionó CPF ni número de pedido, pedí UNO con tono breve y natural.
              PASO 3 — Después de invocar la acción, leé output_pt o output_es palabra por palabra y respondé al cliente. NO inventés "no encontré" sin haber invocado la acción.
              PROHIBIDO:
              - Decir "não encontrei" sin haber llamado la acción primero.
              - Prometer una fecha exacta de entrega — la concesionaria confirma esa fecha.
              SOLO transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router si el cliente cambia de tema.

        actions:
            brand_get_vehicle_order_status: @actions.brand_get_vehicle_order_status
                description: "Look up the vehicle order status NOW for the CPF or order number the caller just mentioned. EXTRACT the CPF exactly as said (e.g., '123.456.789-00'). Always invoke when the caller has provided a CPF."
                with cpf = ...
                with order_number = ...
                with country = @variables.country_code

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after the order status question is answered."

    actions:
        brand_get_vehicle_order_status:
            description: "Lookup new vehicle order status by CPF or order number."
            label: "Get Vehicle Order Status"
            target: "apex://BrandGetVehicleOrderStatus"
            inputs:
                cpf: string
                    description: "Brazilian national ID."
                    is_required: False
                order_number: string
                    description: "Order number."
                    is_required: False
                country: string
                    description: "AR or BR."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                stage_label_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# TECHNICAL LOOKUP — manuals, dashboard buttons, technical bulletins
# ============================================================

subagent technical_lookup:
    label: "Technical Lookup"
    description: "Free-form technical or manual question. E.g., dashboard button, warning light, function explanation."

    before_reasoning:
        set @variables.active_topic = "technical_lookup"
        if @variables.identified == False:
            transition to @subagent.agent_router

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Estás en consultas técnicas. Reglas:
              1. Pedí descripción del síntoma o del botón, y modelo del vehículo si no lo sabés todavía.
              2. Llamá brand_search_manual con la descripción, el modelo y el idioma (es o pt).
              3. La respuesta viene del bulletin o manual oficial. Leéla tal cual — no embellezcas ni paraphrasees.
              4. Si la pregunta es sobre Lexus, pedí modelo y año exactos.
              Después de leer la respuesta, NO llames la acción de nuevo a menos que el cliente cambie de pregunta.
              Cuando termine, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            brand_search_manual: @actions.brand_search_manual
                with description = ...
                with vehicle_model = ...
                with language = ...

            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after the technical question is answered."

    actions:
        brand_search_manual:
            description: "Search <Brand> technical bulletins and owner manuals for a free-form description."
            label: "Search Manual"
            target: "apex://BrandSearchManual"
            inputs:
                description: string
                    description: "Free-text description of the question or symptom."
                    is_required: True
                vehicle_model: string
                    description: "<Brand> or Lexus model name."
                    is_required: False
                language: string
                    description: "es or pt."
                    is_required: False
            outputs:
                success: boolean
                    filter_from_agent: True
                source_document: string
                    filter_from_agent: True
                output_es: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                output_pt: string
                    filter_from_agent: False
                error_message: string
                    filter_from_agent: True

# ============================================================
# ESCALATION
# ============================================================

subagent escalation:
    label: "Escalation"
    description: "Hand off to a human specialist when the agent cannot help, sentiment turns negative, or the caller asks for a human."

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | El cliente necesita un humano. Decí con empatía: "Entiendo. Te paso con un especialista para que te ayude de inmediato. ¿Podés esperar un momento?"
              Luego invocá escalate_to_human para terminar la sesión.

        actions:
            escalate_to_human: @utils.escalate
                description: "Transfer the call to a live human agent."

# ============================================================
# OFF TOPIC
# ============================================================

subagent off_topic:
    label: "Off Topic"
    description: "Caller asked about something outside the <Brand> or Lexus scope."

    reasoning:
        instructions: |
            La consulta está fuera de tu alcance.
            Decí: "Mi especialidad es ayudarte con todo lo relacionado con <Brand>. Para comparaciones con otras marcas, consultá directamente con cada fabricante. ¿Te puedo ayudar con algo de <Brand> hoy?"
            Si el cliente confirma una intención válida, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after redirecting."

# ============================================================
# AMBIGUOUS QUESTION
# ============================================================

subagent ambiguous_question:
    label: "Ambiguous Question"
    description: "Caller's request is unclear and needs clarification."

    reasoning:
        instructions: |
            La consulta del cliente no está clara.
            Pedí más detalles con calma. Por ejemplo: "¿Podrías darme un poco más de detalle sobre lo que necesitás? ¿Es una consulta de service, garantía, plan de ahorro, Fleet o algo distinto?"
            Cuando el cliente clarifique, transicioná a agent_router con go_to_router.

        actions:
            go_to_router: @utils.transition to @subagent.agent_router
                description: "Return to the router after clarification."
